  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tTime and Fees\n\t\tTime and Fees\n\n### Time and Fees: Reports\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 1 Feb, 2024 at 11:01 AM\n\nNavigation: Time and Fees > Reports\n\nClick to redirect to the above navigation\n\nThe Time and Fees Reports section offers a comprehensive breakdown of your practice's profitability and productivity across different categories, including time, expenses, invoices, and user-specific metrics.\n\nTime:\n\nThe Time Report includes:\n\nClient\n\nJob ID\n\nTask\n\nUser\n\nHours\n\nAmount (GBP)\n\nCost (GBP)\n\nProfit (GBP)\n\nThe Report can be customised based on the filters provided, which include:\n\nHours (All, Billable and Non Billable)\n\nGroup by (Client, Job, Task, User, Date)\n\nFilters (Clients, Tasks, Users, Jobs)\n\nPeriod (This Week, Last Week, This Month, Last Month, This Quarter, Last Quarter, This Year, Last Year and Custom)\n\nExpenses:\n\nThe Expenses Report includes:\n\nClient\n\nID\n\nTask\n\nType\n\nUser\n\nAmount (GBP)\n\nThe Report can be customised based on the filters provided, which include:\n\nExpenses (All, Billable and Non Billable)\n\nGroup by (Client, Task, Expense Type, User, Date)\n\nFilters (Clients, Tasks, Users, Expense Type)\n\nPeriod (This Week, Last Week, This Month, Last Month, This Quarter, Last Quarter, This Year, Last Year and Custom)\n\nInvoices:\n\nThe Invoices Report includes:\n\nID\n\nClient\n\nDate\n\nStatus\n\nLast Paid On\n\nInvoiced (GBP)\n\nPaid (GBP)\n\nBalance (GBP)\n\nThe Report can be customised based on the filters provided, which include:\n\nFilters (Clients, Status)\n\nPeriod (This Week, Last Week, This Month, Last Month, This Quarter, Last Quarter, This Year, Last Year and Custom)\n\nUsers:\n\nThe Users Report includes:\n\nUser\n\nTotal Hours\n\nAmount (GBP)\n\nCost (GBP)\n\nProfit (GBP)\n\nThe Report can be customised based on the filters provided, which include:\n\nUser (Contractors, Employees)\n\nPeriod (This Week, Last Week, This Month, Last Month, This Quarter, Last Quarter, This Year, Last Year and Custom)\n\nAll Reports can be exported to Excel, CSV or PDF.\n\nIf you encounter any issues or require further assistance, don't hesitate to reach out to your Onboarding Manager.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
